= The oath changes which side of the door we stand on

Morawiecki presents his third cabinet. PiS retains the offices from which it
commands the police, courts, diplomacy and armed forces. The decree gives
Lewica **[+ ministry_count +] ministries**, each chosen at the negotiating
table rather than assigned by the event.

Razem takes its seats in opposition beside parties that now call us
Kaczyński's majority. Our ministers receive state budgets and civil servants;
they also receive collective responsibility for a cabinet whose senior
direction remains firmly with PiS.

The opposition channel is closed. Government Affairs, cabinet disputes and a
six-month delivery record now replace bargaining from across the aisle.

- @poland_event_queue: Begin the first government programme

@aug21_constructive
title: Force a constructive vote of no confidence
subtitle: Article 158 is available under any President, but a named successor still needs 231 deputies.
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
const storedLeftCommitted = Number(Q.left_committed_seats);
const leftCommitted = Math.max(0, Math.round(
    Number.isFinite(storedLeftCommitted)
        ? storedLeftCommitted
        : (Number(Q.left_seats) || 0)
));
const democraticBase =
    Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.ko_seats) || 0)) +
    Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.psl_seats) || 0)) +
    Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.p2050_seats) || 0)) +
    leftCommitted;
const porozumienieSupport = Math.min(
    Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.other_seats) || 0)),
    Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.porozumienie_seats) || 0))
);
Q.aug21_vonc_left_can_sponsor = leftCommitted >= 46 ? 1 : 0;
Q.aug21_vonc_left_sponsors = leftCommitted;
Q.aug21_vonc_left_votes = leftCommitted;
Q.aug21_vonc_democratic_base = democraticBase;
Q.aug21_vonc_porozumienie_support = porozumienieSupport;
Q.aug21_vonc_other_support = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.round(Number(Q.other_seats) || 0) - porozumienieSupport
);
const konfSeats = Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.konf_seats) || 0));
Q.aug21_vonc_konf_support = Math.min(
    konfSeats,
    Math.max(
        0,
        Math.round(konfSeats * 0.25) +
            (Number(Q.far_right_agenda) >= 60 ? 1 : 0)
    )
);
Q.aug21_technical_cabinet = 0;
!}

= Article 158 — dismissal requires a successor

President **[+ president_name +]** cannot file, vote on or order a Sejm
motion. Under Article 158 the Palace must appoint a successor only if at least
46 deputies sponsor one named candidate and 231 deputies actually elect that
person.

The democratic clubs and Porozumienie currently declare **[+
aug21_vonc_democratic_base +] + [+ aug21_vonc_porozumienie_support +] + [+
aug21_vonc_other_support +]** votes. Konfederacja's **[+
aug21_vonc_konf_support +]** potentially available deputies are a bounded
free-vote estimate, not the whole caucus assigned to a PSL prime minister.

[? if aug21_vonc_left_can_sponsor: Lewica still controls the 46 signatures
needed to force its own motion.?]
[? if not aug21_vonc_left_can_sponsor: Lewica's divided parliamentary family
cannot supply 46 signatures. KO will file the motion instead.?]

- @aug21_vonc_file
- @aug21_vonc_compact
- @aug21_vonc_ai

