@aug21_health
title: Build a cross-party public-health front without PiS control
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Contest the anti-system story with delivery.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: No spare organisational capacity.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; health_policy_pressure += 4; public_trust += 3; pandemic_deaths_pressure -= 2; konf_poll_momentum -= 0.2; psl_relation += 2; p2050_relation += 2; last_policy_stage = "Advocacy"; last_policy_authority = "Opposition local network"; last_policy_implementation = 0; news_headline = "Local health proposals narrow Konfederacja's opening"

Marcelina Zawisza appears with municipal doctors, PSL councillors and Poland
2050 volunteers rather than another row of party leaders. They publish a joint
plan for local vaccination access and hospital staffing, then send the costing
to every opposition-run council willing to use it.

PiS cannot claim the initiative, and Konfederacja finds fewer empty rooms in
which to turn frustration into organisation. It is still an opposition plan,
but it looks like one that could be administered.

- @poland_hub: Continue


@aug21_majority
title: Test whether the minority government can still count
on-arrival: ko_relation += 4; p2050_relation += 3; psl_relation += 2; pis_relation -= 5; constitutional_restraint += 2; party_unity -= 1; news_headline = "The opposition begins counting a government without Gowin"

The whips spend two days matching public declarations against train bookings,
illnesses and deputies who no longer answer their old party phones. KO wants a
spectacular vote. PSL wants a successor before it signs anything. Gowin can
offer six names, not a government.

The count does not bring Morawiecki down. It does establish that he must now
find his missing votes in public, and that the opposition clubs can compare
notes before he does.

- @poland_hub: Continue


@aug21_workers
title: Trade one vote for a worker and hospital package
subtitle: A concrete issue bargain revives every argument from the recovery fund.
on-arrival: government_favors += 1; pis_relation += 5; ko_relation -= 5; razem_dissent += 5; labor_credibility += 4; household_policy_pressure += 3; health_policy_pressure += 2; last_policy_stage = "Negotiated concession"; last_policy_authority = "PiS cabinet and Sejm majority"; last_policy_implementation = 0; news_headline = "A social bargain keeps one government bill alive"

Morawiecki receives the vote he needs. In return, his office signs a timetable
for hospital funding, labour inspections and protection for the lowest-paid
households. The amendments are real; implementation remains in PiS hands.

By the morning KO has cut together another rescue-of-the-government montage,
and Razem is asking why the cabinet's survival was written into the price. The
workers named in the agreement have a more immediate question: whether either
side will honour it.

- @poland_hub: Continue


@aug21_liberty
title: Oppose coercion while rejecting anti-vaccine fantasy
on-arrival: constitutional_restraint += 4; public_trust += 1; pandemic_deaths_pressure += 2; covid_anti_system_pressure += 2; konf_poll_momentum += 0.25; young_support += 1; news_headline = "The Left tries to separate civil liberty from denial"

Our lawyers and doctors draw a careful line: emergency powers need limits,
workers need paid isolation, and lies about vaccines remain lies. The briefing
survives contact with policy reporters. It does not survive the evening clips.

Konfederacja broadcasts the objection to coercion and drops everything that
followed it. A few younger voters listen to the whole argument; the wider
anti-system current grows faster than our qualification can contain it.

- @poland_hub: Continue


