@oct21_eu
# prose-audit: Grade B — Przyłębska, Ziobro, the Commission and the recovery money now stand behind the ruling, each route names who owns the consequence, and the material route is visibly locked to the December 2020 veto position; the judges who dissented are still unnamed.
title: The Tribunal challenges EU-law primacy
subtitle: A disputed court declares parts of the European treaties unconstitutional
