= The legal crisis acquires an invoice

We publish what the frozen recovery money was buying and where: the thermal
retrofits, the hospital equipment, the rail branch, the district heating plant.
Then we publish the daily penalty the Commission is preparing, and what it
equals in each of those.

It is the only version of this argument that reaches somebody who has never
heard of Article 267, and it belongs to us rather than to the party with the
flags. PiS answers that we are pricing Polish sovereignty, which is true, and
that is the argument we want to be having.

