We say it plainly: attaching money to rights produced in three months what two
years of argument did not. It is accurate and it is a useful precedent for
every later conditionality fight, including the ones about courts.

It is also, word for word, the sentence the government wanted us to say. For
the next two years, any Polish party defending EU conditionality is defending
the thing that punished a county for a resolution about ideology.

