= November 2021 — Rage is getting organised

Konfederacja organisers tie anti-vaccine messaging to anti-left rhetoric and
abortion backlash. In county meetings and Telegram channels, doctors are called
"executioners," women's-strike volunteers "foreign agents," and left councillors
"enemies of Polish families." The campaign frame is no longer only taxes and
lockdowns. It is social conflict with named targets.

