@january_2022
# prose-audit: Grade A — Morawiecki's tax launch and the Omicron service crisis are joined through workers and public institutions, with four authored political verdicts rather than headline echoes.
title: The Polish Deal meets Omicron
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
