give every host municipality a reliable count. PSL welcomes an orderly basis
for funding schools and clinics, and security officials gain a process they
can explain.

Leading with screening changes the emotional register of the welcome. Ukrainian
families who were received as neighbours now hear themselves described first
as a risk, and our progressive current makes that cost public.

