Lewica takes stalled municipal projects to the court debate and argues that
institutional repair has a price visible in housing, energy and transport.
KO joins the case, and “rule of law” acquires something more concrete than a
Brussels press conference.

The link is real but delayed. A household opening this month's bill cannot
spend a future KPO project, so the party still lacks an immediate income shield.

- @poland_hub: Continue

