Employer groups and some self-employed professionals welcome a pause in rules
and lower charges. Lewica briefly occupies economic ground Konfederacja assumed
belonged to it alone.

The turn asks workers to wait for cheaper supply while their protections and
public revenue are reduced now. Labour and Razem organise against their own
party's answer, and the radical right claims vindication for setting the terms.

