The policy team joins short-term relief to insulation, municipal heat and
public renewable investment, with costs and delivery offices named. Climate
organisers can defend the emergency package without pretending winter bills
will wait for new infrastructure.

The programme consumes the organisation's remaining capacity and offers less
immediate simplicity than a universal cap. Its reward is a route that does not
repeat the same crisis next year.

- @sep22_reparations: Turn to the reparations report


