= December 2022 — Solidarity has a balance sheet

Refugee services, defence procurement, hospital bills and the energy shield
now compete inside a cabinet we sustain. PiS controls the security ministries;
Lewica ministers are expected to absorb the social consequences. Morawiecki
wants one disciplined vote and no public argument over which side of the
coalition paid for it.

Razem can oppose the whole settlement from outside. We must decide what our
offices are for.

- @budget22_cabinet_shield
- @budget22_cabinet_security
- @budget22_cabinet_brink

