- @mar23_resolution: The resolution reaches the chamber


@mar23_distinguish
title: Reject collective contempt while protecting the inquiry
on-arrival: church_2023_stance = "Faith without impunity"; public_trust += 3; psl_relation += 2; constitutional_restraint += 2; progressive_credibility += 1; barons_dissent -= 2; news_headline = "The Left separates faith from institutional impunity"

Our speakers refuse both the state's canonisation and the lazy claim that Polish
Catholicism is one guilty body. Parish Catholics willing to open the archives
find room beside secular campaigners. Harder voices on both sides call it
evasion; survivors at least keep their claim to facts rather than symbols.

- @mar23_resolution: The resolution reaches the chamber


@mar23_avoid
title: Leave the memory war to PiS and KO
