PiS defends the pope, KO calibrates its distance, and Lewica changes the subject.
The party avoids an argument that can swallow every other issue, but it also
leaves survivors and secular institutions without its parliamentary voice.
Silence proves no safer than taking a side: everyone supplies a motive for us.

- @mar23_resolution: The resolution reaches the chamber


