Constitutional lawyers, former judges and our MPs turn the commission's powers
into a case the public can follow. The challenge denies PiS the language of a
mere party feud and gives Lewica an institutional role distinct from Tusk's.
It cannot, by itself, put a crowd on the streets before the law takes effect.

