= July 2023 — Competing answers to insecurity

Konfederacja is turning pandemic anger, inflation and anti-system media into a
summer surge among voters we have failed to reach. PiS answers with a larger
family benefit, while insecurity near Belarus keeps the border in every
interview. We must decide whether to contest the causes of that anger or adopt
the right's language for it.

