Our floor was costed in January because we paid for it then. It is tabled now,
with the thresholds, the transition month and the instruction sheet the
ministry never wrote, and three government deputies from committee ask for the
working file rather than the press release.

None of it passes. All of it circulates, and for the rest of the parliament the
Left is the opposition party that the finance committee's officials telephone
when they want a number checked.

